B.m0=s(["GAOL is a mobile application developed to digitize pawn services and improve transaction efficiency. The app enables users to pay for pawn extensions, estimate potential loan values, locate the nearest branches using geolocation services, and manage reward or loyalty points.","AbsensiKu is a mobile-based employee management application designed to streamline HR and workforce operations. The app provides features such as attendance tracking, leave management, insurance information, employee loan services, payslip access, and education or training records.","iShop is an e-commerce platform built to provide a seamless online shopping experience for Daikin products. The system allows users to browse product catalogs, view detailed product information, search and filter items, and complete purchases through an integrated checkout flow.","Squadra is a business technology platform that develops multiple digital solutions, including a Point of Sale (POS) system and a Loyalty Points application. The ecosystem is designed to support retail and business operations through integrated transaction management and customer engagement systems.","Milou Farm House is a company profile website developed to showcase the brand, products, and business information in a professional and structured manner. The platform presents company details, product catalogs, galleries, and contact information through a clean and responsive user interface."],t.s)
